      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW OSWALD (6) missed the frame last time at this track but just three runs back flew around 515m at this track in 29.46. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. MORNING (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 29.81 beating White Mocha. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Capable of going well again. REPELLENT (2) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, two back missing the frame but last time hitting the line hard to place when third (34.87) in a Special conditions H at The Meadows last time. Has a good record at this journey. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Expected to be in this for a long way. MEPUNGA RULE (8) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
